  </div>
   <div class="help-faq-grid">

    <div class="help-faq-card">
      <div class="help-faq-icon">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M16 7V5a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v2"/><line x1="12" y1="12" x2="12" y2="16"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="help-faq-body">
        <h3 class="help-faq-title">Quelle technologie utilise le tracker ?</h3>
        <p class="help-faq-text">Le trackeur utilise la technologie GPS avec protocole de commonication LoRaWAN.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
        <div class="help-faq-card">
      <div class="help-faq-icon">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M16 7V5a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v2"/><line x1="12" y1="12" x2="12" y2="16"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="help-faq-body">
        <h3 class="help-faq-title">De quels composants se compose l'Orepmi Tracker 6.7 ?</h3>
        <p class="help-faq-text">L'Orepmi Tracker 6.7 est composé d'un cerveu (MCU), d'un radio LoRa, modules GPS et batterie.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
      <div class="help-faq-card">
      <div class="help-faq-icon">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M16 7V5a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v2"/><line x1="12" y1="12" x2="12" y2="16"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="help-faq-body">
        <h3 class="help-faq-title">Comment Orepmi Tracker 6.7 communique avec le site ?</h3>
        <p class="help-faq-text">L'Orepmi Tracker 6.7 communique avec le site via le protocole LoRaWAN et station de base de TTN pour la transmission des données chez Base de données.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
